    <briefdescription>
<para>The default tick label formatter — produces numeric labels with automatic decimal precision. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The number of decimal places is derived from <emphasis>tickStep</emphasis> so that labels are neither truncated nor cluttered with unnecessary digits.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1DateTimeTickLabelFormatter" kindref="compound">DateTimeTickLabelFormatter</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LogTickLabelFormatter" kindref="compound">LogTickLabelFormatter</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1TickLabelFormatter" kindref="compound">TickLabelFormatter</ref> </para>
